# "When one or more of your opponents are dealt combat damage" (CR 603.2c): the combat damage dealt at once in one combat
# damage step is one event, however many of Bot1's opponents it hurt, so Fblthp's ability triggers once and Bot1 draws two
# cards, not four. Bot1 attacks Bot2 with Llanowar Elves and Bot3 with Elvish Mystic in the same combat, with Fblthp on the
# battlefield watching; Fblthp's own trigger shuffles him into Bot1's library afterwards.

[Bot1 Deck]
Fblthp, Impossibly Lost
Llanowar Elves
Elvish Mystic
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Forest
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T4 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Fblthp, Impossibly Lost.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Elvish Mystic.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Llanowar Elves > Bot2; Elvish Mystic > Bot3)
[T7 Bot1.Main2]

